
[TestChanges_DiscriminatorGained - 1]
# Test: discriminator_gained

## Old Spec:
```yaml
openapi: 3.0.0
info:
  title: Test API
  version: 1.0.0
paths:
  /messages:
    post:
      operationId: sendMessage
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              type: object
              properties:
                content:
                  oneOf:
                    - $ref: '#/components/schemas/TextMessage'
                    - $ref: '#/components/schemas/ImageMessage'
      responses:
        '200':
          description: Success
components:
  schemas:
    TextMessage:
      type: object
      properties:
        text:
          type: string
    ImageMessage:
      type: object
      properties:
        url:
          type: string
```

## New Spec:
```yaml
openapi: 3.0.0
info:
  title: Test API
  version: 1.0.0
paths:
  /messages:
    post:
      operationId: sendMessage
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              type: object
              properties:
                content:
                  oneOf:
                    - $ref: '#/components/schemas/TextMessage'
                    - $ref: '#/components/schemas/ImageMessage'
                  discriminator:
                    propertyName: type
                    mapping:
                      text: '#/components/schemas/TextMessage'
                      image: '#/components/schemas/ImageMessage'
      responses:
        '200':
          description: Success
components:
  schemas:
    TextMessage:
      type: object
      properties:
        type:
          type: string
        text:
          type: string
    ImageMessage:
      type: object
      properties:
        type:
          type: string
        url:
          type: string
```

## Compact Mode:
## Typescript SDK Changes:
* `sdk.sendMessage()`: 
  *  `request.content` **Changed** (Breaking ⚠️)

## Full Mode:
## Typescript SDK Changes:
* `sdk.sendMessage()`: 
  * `request.content` **Changed** (Breaking ⚠️)
    - `union(ImageMessage)` **Removed** (Breaking ⚠️)
    - `union(TextMessage)` **Removed** (Breaking ⚠️)
    - `union(image)` **Added**
    - `union(text)` **Added**

